            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Anne-Charlotte B. is the proud mother of Valentin, born prematurely seven years ago. Despite the complications of the birth, the initial separation and the difficult start to breastfeeding, Valentin gradually gained weight and has never suffered any sequelae. The family has since grown.</AbstractText>
